  "body": "Brand New | Freehold Standalone | Peaceful Cul-de-Sac | Rangi Zones\r\n\r\nA new development where quiet, secure living meets the vibrant Browns Bay community. Nestled in a peaceful, family-friendly cul-de-sac, this brand-new home offers the perfect blend of space, comfort and convenience for modern family living.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n*\tSpacious Living: 4 light-filled bedrooms, perfect for growing families or a dedicated home office.\r\n*\tModern Comfort: 2.5 stylish bathrooms (including a master ensuite) plus a separate laundry space.\r\n*\tPrime Location: Situated on a quiet, safe, cul-de-sac where kids can safely play.\r\n\r\nElite School Schooling\r\nSecure your family's academic future with access to some of the North Shore's most prestigious, top-tier schools:\r\n*\tSherwood School\r\n*\tNorthcross & Murrays Bay Intermediates\r\n*\tRangitoto College & Long Bay College\r\n\r\nThe Ultimate Bays Lifestyle\r\nEverything you need is just minutes away. Walk to the golden sands of Browns Bay Beach, explore Freyberg Park and Sherwood Reserve, or enjoy the local cafes and boutique shops at the town centre. Commuting is effortless with nearby public transport routes and quick access to Westfield Albany and the Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nCCC and Title issued. Don't miss your chance to secure a low-maintenance home in the popular coastal location.\r\n\r\nContact the team today to arrange a private viewing or join us at our Open Home!\r\n\r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/WEA1",
